  "historyNote": "#12060, eff 1-1-17; ss by #14260, eff 8-2-25, EXPIRES: 8-2-35 (formerly Opt 504) (See Chapter 500 Revision Note)",
  "inScheme": "https://granitestate.github.io/rules/scheme",
